flowchart TD
    TASK[Engineering Task]

    RI[Repository Intelligence]
    HM[Harness Memory]
    KG[(Governed Knowledge Graph)]

    LEAD[Lead Agent]
    DEV[Developer Agent]
    REV[Reviewer Agent]
    VAL[Validator Agent]
    EVAL[Evaluator Agent]

    BUILD[Build + Tests]
    PR[Pull Request]
    DEC[Architecture Decisions]

    EXTRACT[Knowledge Extraction]
    GOVERN[Provenance + Confidence + Governance]

    TASK --> LEAD

    RI --> LEAD
    HM --> LEAD
    KG --> LEAD

    LEAD --> DEV
    DEV --> REV
    REV --> VAL
    VAL --> EVAL

    DEV --> BUILD
    REV --> PR
    VAL --> BUILD

    RI --> EXTRACT
    BUILD --> EXTRACT
    PR --> EXTRACT
    DEC --> EXTRACT
    HM --> EXTRACT

    EXTRACT --> GOVERN
    GOVERN --> KG
